<!doctype html>
<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>rec_sample_zkbiotime</title>
  <style>
    @page { margin: 2cm; }
    body { color:#18212b; font-family:"Microsoft YaHei","Segoe UI",sans-serif; line-height:1.55; }
    h1 { font-size:26pt; margin:0 0 8pt; }
    h2 { font-size:18pt; margin:22pt 0 8pt; border-bottom:1pt solid #dce3ea; padding-bottom:6pt; }
    h3 { font-size:14pt; margin:14pt 0 6pt; }
    p { margin:0 0 8pt; }
    .meta { color:#66717d; margin-bottom:14pt; }
    .tabs { margin:10pt 0 18pt; }
    .tab { display:inline-block; border:1pt solid #e6c4aa; padding:4pt 7pt; margin:0 5pt 5pt 0; color:#854513; background:#fff7ef; }
    .step { border:1pt solid #dce3ea; padding:12pt; margin:0 0 12pt; page-break-inside:avoid; }
    .kind { color:#145985; font-weight:bold; }
    .switch { color:#854513; background:#fff8f0; border:1pt dashed #dca977; padding:8pt; margin:8pt 0; }
    .warning { color:#9a3f00; font-weight:bold; }
    .shot { position:relative; max-width:100%; border:1pt solid #dce3ea; overflow:hidden; }
    .shot img { display:block; max-width:100%; height:auto; }
    .focus { position:absolute; border:2pt solid #f18a2a; }
    .focus-zoom { display:none; }
    .mask { position:absolute; background:#111827; }
    .redacted { color:#66717d; font-weight:bold; border:1pt dashed #dce3ea; padding:10pt; }
    .coords { color:#66717d; font-size:9pt; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>rec_sample_zkbiotime</h1>
  <p class="meta">共 9 个操作步骤，其中 2 个标签页切换。</p>
  <div class="tabs"><span class="tab">标签页 A：ZKBio TimeCloud 注册页 · biotimecloud.info</span><span class="tab">标签页 B：邮箱收件箱 · mail.example.com</span></div>
  <h2>操作步骤</h2>
  <article class="step">
  <h3>1. 点击 SIGN UP，进入ZKBio TimeCloud 注册表单页面</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>点击 SIGN UP，进入ZKBio TimeCloud 注册表单页面。</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">高亮区域：x=860, y=520, width=160, height=44</p>
  <p class="coords">点击坐标：x=940, y=542</p>
  
  
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>2. 填写注册邮箱</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在 Email 输入框中填写注册邮箱，系统会通过该邮箱发送激活邮件。</p>
  <p class="warning">此步骤包含敏感字段，已脱敏。</p>
  
  <p class="coords">高亮区域：x=780, y=430, width=320, height=42</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">打码区域：x=780, y=430, width=320, height=42</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>3. 打开标签页 B：邮箱收件箱</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">标签页切换</span></p>
  <div class="switch">标签页 A：ZKBio TimeCloud 注册页 -> 标签页 B：邮箱收件箱</div>
  
  <p>打开标签页 B：邮箱收件箱，查收账号激活邮件。</p>
  
  
  
  
  
  
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>4. 点击 Activate Account</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在邮箱中点击 Activate Account，激活刚注册的账号。</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">高亮区域：x=420, y=360, width=190, height=38</p>
  
  
  
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>5. 切换到标签页 A：ZKBio TimeCloud 注册页</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">标签页切换</span></p>
  <div class="switch">标签页 B：邮箱收件箱 -> 标签页 A：ZKBio TimeCloud 注册页</div>
  
  <p>完成邮箱激活后，切回标签页 A：ZKBio TimeCloud 注册页，继续登录操作。</p>
  
  
  
  
  
  
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>6. 上传 Business License</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在 Business License 中上传文件。</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">高亮区域：x=760, y=610, width=320, height=42</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">打码区域：x=780, y=430, width=320, height=42</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>7. 填写 Support Contact</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在 Support Contact 中输入内容。</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">高亮区域：x=760, y=670, width=320, height=42</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">打码区域：x=780, y=430, width=320, height=42</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>8. 填写 Legal Representative ID</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在 Legal Representative ID 中输入内容。</p>
  <p class="warning">此步骤包含敏感字段，已脱敏。</p>
  
  <p class="coords">高亮区域：x=760, y=730, width=320, height=42</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">打码区域：x=780, y=430, width=320, height=42; x=760, y=730, width=320, height=42</p>
</article>
<article class="step">
  <h3>9. 填写 Billing Bank Card</h3>
  <p><span class="kind">操作步骤</span></p>
  
  
  <p>在 Billing Bank Card 中输入内容。</p>
  <p class="warning">此步骤包含敏感字段，已脱敏。</p>
  
  <p class="coords">高亮区域：x=760, y=790, width=320, height=42</p>
  
  
  <p class="coords">打码区域：x=780, y=430, width=320, height=42; x=760, y=730, width=320, height=42; x=760, y=790, width=320, height=42</p>
</article>
</body>
</html>